# AGENTS.md "Directory rules": artifacts/ keeps measurement records and the scripts that
# produce them, never renders. A gate's PNGs regenerate from the capture script next to
# them, so a `--out` pointed inside artifacts/ is a mistake, not a deliverable.
artifacts/exhibits/*/gate-evidence/
